    content: "After joining a stream channel, you listen to event notifications in the channel. To send and receive messages in the channel, you use topics. Signaling allows thousands of stream channels to exist simultaneously in your app. However, due to client-side performance and bandwidth limitations, a single client may only join a limited number of channels concurrently. For details, see API usage restrictions."
